split-typing-trainer
====================

This project is an original reimplementation (in HTML/JavaScript) inspired by
the mechanics of the educational typing-practice software
"美佳のタイプトレーナ (Mika Type Trainer)" by 今村二朗 (Jiro Imamura).

Original source (Java version):
  https://github.com/MIKATYPE/MIKATYPE_JAVA
Author's website:
  https://www.asahi-net.or.jp/~bg8j-immr/

