Bundled third-party components
------------------------------

This repository bundles kuromoji.js and its dictionary (under dict/) so that
Japanese kanji-to-reading conversion works from the same origin.

kuromoji.js — Copyright Atilika Inc. and contributors.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/takuyaa/kuromoji.js

Dictionary: MeCab IPADIC (mecab-ipadic-2.7.0-20070801),
  derived from data by Nara Institute of Science and Technology (NAIST)
  and including ICOT Free Software.
  Redistributed unmodified under its original terms
  (attribution and disclaimer preserved).

The kuromoji.js runtime script itself is currently loaded from a CDN
(cdn.jsdelivr.net); only the dictionary files are bundled here.
